      "edition": "Wednesday 11 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Coaching appointment",
          "heading": "Jake White named Fiji head coach ahead of 2027 Rugby World Cup",
          "body": "Fiji's Nations Championship campaign sits with Jake White, whose appointment ahead of the 2027 World Cup was reported last month. His side slumped to a fourth straight defeat in the inaugural Nations Championship, going down 54-17 to France in Lyon after starting with 10 France-based players, including their entire backline. Ireland are next for the Flying Fijians, who have won none of their four matches."
        },
