    "388": {
      "date": "2026-11-11",
      "edition": "Wednesday 11 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Ciaran Frawley expected to start at out-half against Fiji on Saturday",
          "body": "Ciaran Frawley is expected to start at out-half for Saturday's Nations Championship match against Fiji, his second run at No. 10 in four Tests. Jack Crowley remains unavailable through injury, and Frawley, a 16-cap utility player, has spent recent seasons as a utility option rather than a specialist 10. Having kicked the Durban drop goal that beat South Africa in 2024 from the bench, he said he has \"definitely matured a lot\" since the 2022 tour to New Zealand."
        },
