          "kicker": "Squad news",
          "heading": "Quesada brings Riccardo Casarin and Antony Italo Miranda into Argentina camp",
          "body": "Italy coach Gonzalo Quesada has added two invitees to the Argentina camp: Riccardo Casarin, a centre from Valorugby, and Antony Italo Miranda, a back-rower from Mogliano, both joining after the squad list went out. Casarin captained Italy U20 in the last Six Nations and the Junior Rugby World Cup and has made an URC debut for Zebre; Miranda also played for the U20s last season. Both are joining the camp in Turin as Italy prepare for Saturday's test against Argentina."
