          "kicker": "Standing debate",
          "heading": "Centre Jones says Scotland have yet to prove they're top-tier",
          "body": "Jones made the point after last Saturday's 43-21 defeat by New Zealand at Murrayfield. Former captain John Barclay pointed to red-zone efficiency, with Scotland converting 30% of visits to the 22 against New Zealand's 58%. Scotland sit sixth of 12 in the log on two wins and two defeats from four matches, and their next test is against Australia."
