          "kicker": "Injury doubt",
          "heading": "Wales face Aaron Wainwright injury doubt for All Blacks clash on Saturday",
          "body": "Lydiate, Wales's contact skills coach and a former Wainwright team-mate, described the leg problem as \"a minor injury\" but said the number eight may not be available. Wainwright, 29, did not train on Tuesday and was still in a protective boot, with Steve Tandy due to name the team on Thursday. If he is out, Taine Basham, the Cardiff number eight, is the likely replacement and would make his first international start since the 2022 Six Nations against England."
