          "kicker": "Injury blow",
          "heading": "Juan Cruz Mallía ruled out of Nations Championship with knee sprain",
          "body": "Mallía left the field just after the hour mark in Friday's loss to Ireland in Dublin, and the Argentine Rugby Federation announced on Monday that the Toulouse back will miss the rest of the Nations Championship. Uncapped Tobías Wade, a Zebre back, joins the squad in his place. Coach Felipe Contepomi has also added hookers Bautista Bernasconi and Facundo Bosch after Julián Montoya, who failed a head injury assessment in Dublin, was left in doubt for Saturday's match against Italy in Genoa."
